{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a scene to save and load whole worlds, such as a game’s save file or a level made in an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editor, or to store a group of entities you spawn many times, such as an enemy squad. Take a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scene with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/scene(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", passing a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry"},{"type":"text","text":" of the types to save. Then either"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rebuild the whole world with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"World(restoring:)"},{"type":"text","text":", or add the scene’s entities to another"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world as new ones with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/spawn(contentsOf:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A scene is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"text":". Encoding needs nothing more; decoding needs the registry in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"decoder’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userInfo"},{"text":" under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CodingUserInfoKey.typeRegistry"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","","var registry = TypeRegistry()","try registry.register(Name.self, named: \"Name\")","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Ship\"))","let turret = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Turret\"))","try world.addChild(turret, to: ship)","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(world.scene(registry))","","let decoder = JSONDecoder()","decoder.userInfo[.typeRegistry] = registry","let scene = try decoder.decode(Scene.self, from: data)","print(scene.count)","\/\/ Prints \"2\"","","let restored = World(restoring: scene)","print(restored.parent(of: turret) == ship)","\/\/ Prints \"true\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Restoring keeps every entity handle, live or stale, meaning the same as in the original"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world, and the restored world hands out the same handles from later spawns. Types the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registry names but the data doesn’t are left out."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene holds no hooks, observers, caches, indexes or change ticks, and the restored world’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components are all added at its first tick."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decoding throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DecodingError.dataCorrupted"},{"type":"text","text":" when the decoder’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userInfo"},{"type":"text","text":" has no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registry, when the data names a type the registry doesn’t, or for data that no world could"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"have produced."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/scene"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],